{"request_sha256": "fee693f52d4fbff55d0f0e40bd49d037db408ad774d28dc2f2f3639807debfb1", "prompt_sha256": "41ce0317d48d66c48f27d90ac1b32c243e3040b9e4e995bf9fe78793a495333b", "dispatched_prompt_sha256": "158a26cbdb064f73a9dd1652956465109c2e42cd3cb39c4f92acc490ee541d1c", "schema_sha256": "16e85d59e1b5b494dcb4212f6a717d121774f1597ba7eb3b65eaf0b4c9e5ff18", "model": "opus", "model_identity_basis": "claude CLI result event modelUsage key: claude-opus-5-5", "effort": "medium", "status": "ok", "forbidden_tools": [], "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 10373}, "answer": {"passes": ["fail", "fail", "fail", "fail", "fail", "fail", "pass", "pass", "pass", "pass", "fail", "fail", "fail", "fail", "pass", "pass", "fail", "fail", "pass", "pass", "fail", "fail", "pass", "pass", "pass", "pass"], "defects": [{"defect": "Fronds are straight spokes radiating from the apex, forming a starburst or sphere outline, not the arching, recurved, hemispherical to shuttlecock crown seen in reference-0. Only a few of the lowest fronds angle below the crown base, and none hang. This is true of both seeds (render-0, render-1).", "trait_id": "crown-pinnate-arching-fronds"}, {"defect": "Fronds are short relative to the trunk. They are about 0.3 of the visible trunk length in render-0 and render-1, against about 0.5-0.6 in reference-0. Leaflets are sparse and thin, so each frond reads as a thin, spiky line instead of the dense, plumose frond in reference-0 and reference-1. This matches the owner's complaint.", "trait_id": "crown-pinnate-arching-fronds"}, {"defect": "In the whole views (render-0, render-1) the fronds read near-black dark green against the sky, not blue-green to grey-green. Grey-green leaflet faces show only in the closer render-2, and many leaflet faces there are still black.", "trait_id": "frond-colour-range"}, {"defect": "The trunk is a smooth, bark-grained cylinder with sparse, widely spaced cylindrical pegs (render-0, render-1, render-2, render-3). It does not have the dense spiral diamond/rhomboid lattice of blunt wedge stubs with flat angular faces seen in reference-1 and reference-2, or the continuous knobbly texture seen in reference-0.", "trait_id": "trunk-leaf-base-diamond-pattern"}, {"defect": "In close-up (render-3) the leaf-base stubs are long, round-ended cylinders with bark texture that stick out at angles. They read as sawn branch stumps on a pole, not as palm leaf bases.", "trait_id": "trunk-leaf-base-diamond-pattern"}, {"defect": "There is no fibrous matting between the stubs. The trunk surface between pegs is bare bark (render-2, render-3), unlike the dense reddish-brown fibre in reference-1 and reference-2.", "trait_id": "trunk-fibrous-matting"}, {"defect": "A hanging collar sits below the crown in the right place, but it reads green (render-0, render-1) or blue-grey (render-2), like live foliage. It does not show the brown dead fronds or the sharp green-to-brown transition seen in reference-0.", "trait_id": "dead-frond-skirt"}], "observations": ["Render order is render-0 (seed 1, P-WHOLE), render-1 (seed 42, P-WHOLE), render-2 (seed 1, P-TRUNK), render-3 (seed 1, P-BASE), followed by reference-0/1/2 and the spruce anchor-0.", "render-3 is marked visibility 'hidden' in the metadata, yet the supplied image clearly shows a close-up of the trunk with its leaf-base stubs. It was assessed from what is visible, and the metadata conflict is recorded.", "Both seeds are structurally near-identical: a very tall, slender, straight trunk carrying a small starburst crown.", "The anchor (anchor-0) was used only as a finish floor. The render finish (shading, texture, clean geometry) is at or above that floor, so the failures are about species character, not finish.", "fruit-clusters-pendent is a known gap (fn-111) and was not assessed.", "A relative improvement over earlier candidates would not mean this candidate is ready. Several core and owner-priority traits fail outright."], "findings": [{"observation": "Both seeds show a single rosette of about 25-35 pinnate fronds radiating from one apical point. Every frond is nearly straight, so the crown outline is a starburst rather than arching or recurved.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "crown-pinnate-arching-fronds"}, {"observation": "Measured by eye, frond length is about 0.3 of the trunk length in the renders, against about 0.5-0.6 in reference-0. The trunk is also very slender and tall relative to the crown.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": true, "causal_hypothesis": "The frond length and leaflet size dials may be set too low, as the owner notes.", "trait_id": "crown-silhouette-proportions"}, {"observation": "Leaflets are narrow, sharp-pointed and spread at different angles, giving a bristly frond margin. They are sparse and short compared with the dense fronds in reference-1.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "leaflet-arrangement-stiff-narrow"}, {"observation": "The frond material is grey-green on lit faces in render-2, but many leaflet faces render black. At whole-tree scale the crown reads near-black dark green.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-1"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": "Unlit or backfacing leaflet sides may be dominating the whole-view read.", "trait_id": "frond-colour-range"}, {"observation": "The trunk is straight in seed 1 and very slightly leaning in seed 42. Diameter is near-constant, with a small flare at the ground. It is unbranched and not wavy.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "solitary-columnar-stem"}, {"observation": "No foliage, epiphytes or branches grow along the trunk shaft. The stubs read as small knobs at whole-tree scale. This meets the owner's 'nothing grows on the trunk' requirement at P-WHOLE.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "epiphytes-on-trunk"}, {"observation": "The trunk shows sparse cylindrical pegs in a loose spiral on smooth bark. There is no dense diamond lattice of wedge-shaped stubs.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "render-3", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "trunk-leaf-base-diamond-pattern"}, {"observation": "The close-up stubs are round-ended cylinders that read as branch stumps. They have no flat angular faces.", "evidence_ids": ["render-3", "reference-2"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": true, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "trunk-leaf-base-diamond-pattern"}, {"observation": "No fibre or husk fills the spaces between stubs.", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "render-3", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "trunk-fibrous-matting"}, {"observation": "A collar hangs against the upper trunk below the crown, but it is green or blue-grey rather than brown. There is no visible transition from living to dead fronds.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-0"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "dead-frond-skirt"}, {"observation": "The trunk colour is mid grey-brown to warm brown, and the stub ends are slightly lighter. This is within the reference range, though the renders lack the bleached pale-grey stub faces.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-2", "render-3", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "trunk-colour-and-weathering"}, {"observation": "The trunk widens slightly where it meets the ground in both seeds.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": true, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "basal-flare"}, {"observation": "The apex in render-2 shows only a small brown knob. There are no yellow-green petioles or rust-orange sheath fibre.", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1"], "impact": "optional", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "petiole-base-orange-sheath"}, {"observation": "The fronds sit directly on the upper trunk. There is no smooth green crownshaft.", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "crown-shaft-absent"}, {"observation": "The straight, near-vertical posture falls within the posture range the references show.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "impact": "variation", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "trunk-lean-and-curve"}, {"observation": "Fruit clusters are a known generator gap (fn-111) and were not assessed.", "evidence_ids": [], "impact": "optional", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null, "trait_id": "fruit-clusters-pendent"}], "coverage": [{"trait_id": "crown-pinnate-arching-fronds", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "explanation": "The crown is a rosette of pinnate fronds, but the fronds are straight, short spokes. The arching, recurved, hemispherical to shuttlecock outline and the drooping lowest fronds seen in reference-0 are missing."}, {"trait_id": "leaflet-arrangement-stiff-narrow", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "Leaflets are narrow, stiff and sharp, set at varied angles, and give a bristly margin. They are sparse, but that is a matter of size and density, not arrangement."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-leaf-base-diamond-pattern", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-2", "render-3", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "The renders show sparse cylindrical pegs on smooth bark, not a dense spiral lattice of wedge-shaped stubs."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-fibrous-matting", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "render-3", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "No fibre is drawn between the stubs."}, {"trait_id": "solitary-columnar-stem", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "explanation": "The stem is single, unbranched and of near-constant diameter."}, {"trait_id": "fruit-clusters-pendent", "status": "unknown", "evidence_ids": [], "explanation": "This is a known gap (fn-111) and was not assessed."}, {"trait_id": "dead-frond-skirt", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-0"], "explanation": "A collar is present below the crown, but it reads as green or blue-grey live foliage, with no brown dead fronds and no abrupt transition."}, {"trait_id": "frond-colour-range", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-1"], "explanation": "The owner requires the fronds to read blue-green to grey-green. At P-WHOLE they read near-black green."}, {"trait_id": "petiole-base-orange-sheath", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1"], "explanation": "There are no pale petioles or orange sheath fibre at the apex."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-lean-and-curve", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-1"], "explanation": "The trunk is straight or gently leaning, which is within the reference range and matches the owner requirement."}, {"trait_id": "epiphytes-on-trunk", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-1"], "explanation": "No epiphytes are drawn. Their absence is acceptable variation and matches the owner's 'nothing grows on the trunk'."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-colour-and-weathering", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-2", "render-3", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "explanation": "The trunk is grey-brown to warm brown with slightly lighter stub ends."}, {"trait_id": "basal-flare", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "explanation": "The base widens slightly at the ground."}, {"trait_id": "crown-shaft-absent", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1"], "explanation": "No crownshaft is drawn."}, {"trait_id": "basal-leaflet-spines", "status": "unknown", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1"], "explanation": "Spines near the frond base cannot be resolved in the renders, and the inventory trait is itself marked uncertain."}, {"trait_id": "crown-silhouette-proportions", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "explanation": "Frond length is a much smaller fraction of trunk length than in reference-0. The owner confirms the fronds are too short."}]}, "raw_events": "{"type":"system","subtype":"init","cwd":"/home/daniel/Projects/telperion/.worktrees/fn-80-the-gap-loops-first-live-run","session_id":"ab714798-d141-42f4-afdb-0be6e73d7878","tools":["StructuredOutput"],"mcp_servers":[],"model":"claude-opus-5-5","permissionMode":"default","slash_commands":["deep-research","design","design-sync","dataviz","update-config","verify","debug","code-review","simplify","batch","fewer-permission-prompts","doctor","loop","schedule","claude-api","workflow-authoring","run","run-skill-generator","advisor","agents","auto-mode-setup","autocompact","clear","color","compact","config","output-style","context","effort","fast","heapdump","init","mcp","import","model","__remote-workflow","workflow-launch-exec","reload-plugins","reload-skills","rename","ultrareview","security-review","usage-credits","extra-usage","usage","insights","recap","skill-doctor","goal","design-consent","design-revoke","list-agent